        "id": 1440,
        "name": "Fire Emblem: The Sacred Stones",
        "summary": "In Fire Emblem: The Sacred Stones, you must help protect the nation of Renais from the invading Grado Empire. Plan your strategy, choose your units, and then lead your soldiers in to battle. The more experience your soldiers gain, the more you can upgrade their abilities. This time, your soldiers can gain experience by fighting new monsters in the Tower of Valni.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25q4.jpg",
        "release_date": 1097107200,
        "rating": 90.78533299096304,
        "rating_count": 131,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)|Strategy|Turn-based strategy (TBS)|Tactical",
        "platform_ids": "37,41,24",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fire-emblem-the-sacred-stones",
        "cached_at": 1772208560
      },
      {
        "id": 3683,
        "name": "Mother 3",
        "summary": "A turn-based JRPG and sequel to EarthBound (1994) in which a tragedy surrounding a family in the primitive yet joyful village of Tazmily incites the coming-of-age story of Lucas, the family's younger son, who goes on perilous adventures along with his friends in order to find his missing brother and stop a group of masked men from bringing about the end of the world.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coa3qi.jpg",
        "release_date": 1145491200,
        "rating": 90.0982974222733,
        "rating_count": 173,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)|Turn-based strategy (TBS)",
        "platform_ids": "41,24",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mother-3",
        "cached_at": 1772208560
      },
      {
        "id": 2899,
        "name": "EarthBound",
        "summary": "A turn-based JRPG and sequel to then-Japan-only Earthbound Beginnings (1989) in which Ness, a young boy living in a land based on the USA, leaves home to go on an adventure through strange locations, get to know quirky characters and defeat an unknowable alien threat called Giygas while facing up to the realities of growing up and becoming familiar with the real world.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6v07.jpg",
        "release_date": 777945600,
        "rating": 89.2867953514137,
