        "platform_ids": "19,41,137,24,58",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/earthbound",
        "cached_at": 1772208560
      },
      {
        "id": 1757,
        "name": "Mega Man Battle Network 3 White",
        "summary": "Using an RPG style, you must guide Mega Man through various levels defeating enemies along the way and collecting the various chips to upgrade Mega Man's weapons and other items.\n\nExclusive to this, the White Version, are specialy developed chips (Giga Class chips) that only the White Version of Mega Man can use. You can also trade various chips between players using either Blue or White versions of BN3. Other differences include exclusive enemy bosses in areas and a unique battle style for each games version that Mega Man can use.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co203l.jpg",
        "release_date": 1039132800,
        "rating": 88.78977108373951,
        "rating_count": 28,
        "genres": "Real Time Strategy (RTS)|Role-playing (RPG)|Tactical",
        "platform_ids": "24",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mega-man-battle-network-3-white",
        "cached_at": 1772208560
      },
      {
        "id": 1173,
        "name": "Golden Sun: The Lost Age",
        "summary": "The story of Golden Sun: The Lost Age picks up right near the end of the first game. Golden Sun veterans will be surprised to learn that The Lost Age is played from the point of view of the party being chased as they try to light the remaining two lighthouses, which will unlock the power of alchemy for the world--or will it instead unlock the world's destruction?\n\n* LAN PVP mode via GBA Game Link Cable",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co25rt.jpg",
        "release_date": 1025222400,
        "rating": 88.6088906415641,
        "rating_count": 89,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "41,24",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/golden-sun-the-lost-age",
        "cached_at": 1772208560
      },
      {
