      {
        "id": 16748,
        "name": "Super Mario Advance 4: Super Mario Bros. 3",
        "summary": "Super Mario Advance 4 is a GBA remake of Super Mario Bros. 3 for the NES.\n\nSuper Mario Advance is a four-part series for the GBA with Super Mario games of the NES and SNES era. The remakes came with adjusted graphics, sound and additional content. Each game of the series includes additionally the arcade-classic \"Mario Bros\" which can be played in multiplayer via link cable.",
